                                                "sense_id": "9995fd5f-e104-3e0f-ae93-d65964ac33e1",
                                                "text": "I have selected a few dishes, and made out a little bill of fare, which will go home in the steamer that precedes me, and be hot when I arrive—as follows: […] Apple puffs, Southern style. Peach cobbler, Southern style. Peach pie. American mince pie."
